      "id": "claim_c5f7316cc624418299505b44bca1d19b",
      "statement": "The app is a single-deployment full-stack system: main.py mounts the built React SPA with app.frontend(\"/\", directory=\"frontend/dist\") and the frontend uses an empty API_BASE so all fetch calls are same-origin relative paths against the FastAPI process that owns the API.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://frontend/src/App.jsx#L6-L6",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:cc206438df451e7329f5bc74877716031f1871eac4b00b7766627f127e3c42c8:"
