    {
      "id": "claim_d6233694c6a345d8bf98abfcd7d256f6",
      "statement": "POST /scan resolves a barcode to a product and variety, then for weight-tracked varieties deducts the package_size_grams from batches ordered by expiry_date, spilling any remainder into the next batch in expiry order; for unit-tracked varieties it decrements one unit from the earliest-expiring batch that still has units_remaining > 0.",
