    {
      "id": "claim_1a0d706fb08f493d8293262573baf9c5",
      "statement": "The architecture's core constraint is expiry-aware FIFO consumption: each restock creates a new batch with its own expiry_date, and deduction always targets the earliest-expiring batch first, spilling across subsequent batches in expiry order for weight products so older inventory is consumed before it expires.",
